<BODY>

<p><font color=GREEN>48-5504</font>. <font color=PURPLE><u>Officers of the board</u></font></p>

<p>Within thirty days after an election the board of directors shall meet and organize by electing a chairman and a vice-chairman from its members. In addition, the board of directors may appoint a secretary who shall not be a member of the board and who may be paid a salary fixed by the board. </p>

</BODY>

